prietest wielded the mace and the mace wielded itself to her hand (!! Ha!). The
Earth elemental wasn't a big problem. And all the poor prietest could do was 
zapping magic missles! So she was wasted before long. Well I felt kind of
guilty doing all this. So I managed to convert it back to neutral and, hey,
the God was pretty forgiving! I got him pleased with just a few #offers!

And I wasn't a tough dude at all. Something like AC-5, STR10, EXP10, HP67, etc
with blessed +0 Magicbane and overloaded all the time. Not a smart game at all.
Unless it's all because of that Maigcbane. I doubt it.

